# CleanField / Usarya SCS-100 stone picker - drawbar lifting, empty hopper, physical load model.
# Kinematics as drawbar.mech; two cylinders 100/50 in parallel are modelled as one with twice the piston
# area. The frame carries its own weight at its centre of gravity: machine mass 12 400 kg less the drawbar
# (315 kg, on the drawbar) = 12 085 kg. The centre of gravity lies 0 mm above the frame beam AB (normal
# to it); its position along the beam is set so that the hitch reaction is the 7650 kg of the operating
# manual at ED = 935 mm. The axle (A) and hitch (level) reactions then follow from the kinematics.
# Generated by make_drawbar_frame.py. Units mm, kg.
title Usarya stone picker - drawbar lifting, frame weight at its centre of gravity (0 mm above the beam)
body frame drawbar hitch
revolute A ground frame 0.0 0.0
revolute B frame drawbar 4900.41877 881.09979
revolute C drawbar hitch 6734.78192 0.0
prismatic level ground hitch 6734.78192 0.0 1 0
actuator ED frame 4811.05236 1378.12961 drawbar 5661.67337 989.96870 bore=141.421 rod=70.711 min=715 max=935
mass drawbar drawbar 5817.60035 440.54990 315
mass frame_carried frame 4111.5879 739.2673 12085 0
